- Some late-game casual rates (L88, L99, L104, L112, L114) spike against their neighbours. These look like genuine difficulty, not guessing, so they need a softer ramp, not a redesign.
- The final-third casual average is on target (about 60%).
- Compared with Picross S and Nonogram.com, the pictures are charming but the "aha" density is uneven. Colour and cracked levels are stronger than the early monochrome ones.
